**Request**: `CreateGroupRequest`
```typescript
interface CreateGroupRequest {
  name: string;
  description?: string;
  avatar_file_id?: string;
  tags?: string[];
  password?: string;
  join_method?: GroupJoinMethod;
  is_searchable?: boolean;
  max_members?: number;
  location: Location;
}
```

**Response**: `ApiResponse<GroupItem>`

**错误码**: `10000` `10300` `22000` `22002`

